= Notes on Marriage / 结婚札记

== First note / 第一份札记

#html.p(id: "en-S001")[#text("Work finished")]

#zh(id: "S001")[#text("手头的工作完成以后")]

#html.p(id: "en-S002")[#text("If not marry | Travel. Europe, yes? | America????")]

#zh(id: "S002")[#text("如果不结婚｜旅行。欧洲，可以？｜美洲？？？？")]

#html.p(id: "en-S003")[#text("If I travel it must be exclusively geological United States, Mexico Depend upon health & vigour & how far I become Zoological")]

#zh(id: "S003")[#text("如果去旅行，就必须专门考察地质。美国、墨西哥。取决于健康和精力，以及我究竟会多深入动物学。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S004")[#text("If I dont travel.- Work at transmission of Species- Microscope simplest forms of life- Geology. ?.oldest formations?? Some experimets- physiological observation on lower animals")]

#zh(id: "S004")[#text("如果不旅行——研究物种的传承——用显微镜观察最简单的生命形式——地质学。？最古老的地层？？做些实验——对低等动物进行生理观察。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S005")[#text("B Live in London for where else possible in small house, near Regents Park-keep horse-take Summer tours Collect specimens some line of Zoolog: Speculations of Geograph. range, & Geological general works.-Systematiz.- Study affinities.")]

#zh(id: "S005")[#text("B：住在伦敦，还能住在哪里呢？在摄政公园附近住一间小房子——养匹马——夏天出游，采集某一动物学方向的标本。思考地理分布，开展一般地质研究——分类整理——研究亲缘关系。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S006")[#text("Work finished")]

#zh(id: "S006")[#text("手头的工作完成以后")]

#html.p(id: "en-S007")[#text("If marry-means limited, Feel duty to work for money. London life, nothing but Society, no country, no tours, no large Zoolog. Collect. no books. Cambridge Professorship, either Geolog. or Zoolog.- comply with all above requisites- I could not systematiz zoologically so well.- But better than hybernating in country, & where? Better even than near London country house.- I could not indolently take country house & do nothing- Could I live in London like a prisoner? If I were moderately rich, I would live in London, with pretty big house & do as (B), but could I act thus with children & poor? No- Then where live in country near London; better, but great obstacles to science & poverty. Then Cambridge, better, but fish out of water, not being Professor & poverty. Then Cambridge Professorship,-& make best of it, do duty as such & work at spare times- ¶ My destiny will be Camb. Prof. or poor man; outskirts of London, some small Square &c:- & work as well as I can")]

#zh(id: "S007")[#text("如果结婚——财力有限，会觉得自己有义务工作挣钱。伦敦的生活，除了社交还是社交，没有乡野，没有旅行，没有大型动物学收藏，没有书。剑桥的教授职位，无论地质学还是动物学——既要符合前述所有要求，又无法把动物学材料系统整理得那么好。不过总比在乡间冬眠强，而又能去哪里呢？甚至比住在伦敦附近的乡间住宅好——我无法懒洋洋地住在乡下，无所事事。我能像囚犯一样住在伦敦吗？假如我还算富裕，就住在伦敦一所相当大的房子里，照 B 那样做；可是有了孩子又穷，能这样生活吗？不能。那么住在哪里？伦敦附近的乡间；好一些，但贫穷和科学研究会遇到很大的障碍。那就剑桥，比较好，却不是教授，既如鱼离水，又穷。那就谋一个剑桥教授职位——尽力而为，尽到教授的责任，利用空闲时间研究。¶ 我的命运会是剑桥教授，或者一个穷人；住在伦敦郊外某个小广场之类的地方——尽我所能地工作。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S008")[#text("I have so much more pleasure in direct observation, that I could not go on as Lyell does, correcting & adding up new information to old train & I do not see what line can be followed by man tied down to London.-")]

#zh(id: "S008")[#text("直接观察带给我的乐趣大得多，我无法像赖尔那样，沿着原有思路不断修订、补充新的资料；而一个被拴在伦敦的人，还能走哪条研究道路，我也看不出来。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S009")[#text("In country, experiment & observations on lower animals,-more space-")]

#zh(id: "S009")[#text("在乡间，对低等动物做实验和观察——空间更大。")]

== Second note / 第二份札记

#html.p(id: "en-S010")[#text("This is the Question")]

#zh(id: "S010")[#text("这就是问题所在")]

#html.p(id: "en-S011")[#text("Marry")]

#zh(id: "S011")[#text("结婚")]

#html.p(id: "en-S012")[#text("Children-(if it Please God) - Constant companion, (& friend in old age) who will feel interested in one,- object to be beloved & played with.- -better than a dog anyhow.- Home, & someone to take care of house- Charms of music & female chit-chat.- These things good for one's health.- but terrible loss of time . -")]

#zh(id: "S012")[#text("孩子——如果上帝愿意的话——长久的伴侣（也是老年时的朋友），有人关心自己——一个可以爱、可以一起嬉闹的人——总比一条狗好。一个家，有人照料家务——音乐与女性闲谈的魅力——这些都有益于健康——但会损失大量时间。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S013")[#text("My God, it is intolerable to think of spending ones whole life, like a neuter bee, working, working, & nothing after all.- No, no won't do.- Imagine living all one's day solitarily in smoky dirty London House.- Only picture to yourself a nice soft wife on a sofa with good fire, & books & music perhaps- Compare this vision with the dingy reality of Grt. Marlbro' St.")]

#zh(id: "S013")[#text("我的上帝，想到一辈子像工蜂那样，工作、工作，到头来却什么也没有，真令人无法忍受。不，不，这不行。想象一下，终日独自住在伦敦一所烟熏火燎、肮脏的房子里。再想象一下，温柔可爱的妻子坐在沙发上，炉火温暖，也许还有书和音乐——把这个画面同大马尔伯勒街阴暗的现实比较一下。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S014")[#text("Marry-Mary-Marry Q.E.D.,")]

#zh(id: "S014")[#text("结婚——结婚——结婚。证毕。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S015")[#text("Not Marry")]

#zh(id: "S015")[#text("不结婚")]

#html.p(id: "en-S016")[#text("Freedom to go where one liked- choice of Society & little of it . - Conversation of clever men at clubs- Not forced to visit relatives, & to bend in every trifle.- to have the expense & anxiety of children- perhaps quarelling- Loss of time . - cannot read in the Evenings- fatness & idleness- Anxiety & responsibility- less money for books &c- if many children forced to gain one's bread.- (But then it is very bad for ones health to work too much)")]

#zh(id: "S016")[#text("自由地去想去的地方——自己选择交往对象，而且少些社交——在俱乐部同聪明人交谈——不必被迫探望亲戚，不必在每件小事上迁就别人——不必承担养孩子的开销与忧虑——也许还会争吵——损失时间——晚上不能读书——发胖与懒散——忧虑和责任——买书等事情的钱变少——如果孩子多，就被迫为生计奔忙。（不过，工作过度也很伤身体。）")]

#html.p(id: "en-S017")[#text("Perhaps my wife wont like London; then the sentence is banishment & degradation into indolent, idle fool-")]

#zh(id: "S017")[#text("也许妻子不喜欢伦敦；那么判决就是流放，把我贬成一个懒惰、无所事事的傻瓜。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S018")[#text("It being proved necessary to Marry")]

#zh(id: "S018")[#text("既然已经证明有必要结婚")]

#html.p(id: "en-S019")[#text("When? Soon or Late")]

#zh(id: "S019")[#text("何时？早些还是晚些")]

#html.p(id: "en-S020")[#text("The Governor says soon for otherwise bad if one has children- one's character is more flexible-one's feelings more lively & if one does not marry soon, one misses so much good pure happiness.-")]

#zh(id: "S020")[#text("老爷子说应该早些，否则有了孩子就不妙——人的性格还更容易改变，感情也更鲜活；若不早点结婚，就会错过那么多美好而纯粹的幸福。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S021")[#text("But then if I married tomorrow: there would be an infinity of trouble & expense in getting & furnishing a house,-fighting about no Society-morning calls-awkwardness-loss of time every day. (without one's wife was an angel, & made one keep industrious). Then how should I manage all my business if I were obliged to go every day walking with my wife.- Eheu!! I never should know French,-or see the Continent-or go to America, or go up in a Balloon, or take solitary trip in Wales-poor slave.-you will be worse than a negro- And then horrid poverty, (without one's wife was better than an angel & had money)- Never mind my boy- Cheer up- One cannot live this solitary life, with groggy old age, friendless & cold, & childless staring one in ones face, already beginning to wrinkle.- Never mind, trust to chance-keep a sharp look out- There is many a happy slave-")]

#zh(id: "S021")[#text("可是，如果我明天就结婚：找房子、布置房子会带来无穷的麻烦与开销——为缺少社交争吵——上午的拜访——尴尬——每天损失时间。（除非妻子是个天使，让我始终勤奋。）如果每天都必须陪妻子散步，我又怎样料理自己的全部事务呢？唉！！我将永远学不会法语——看不到欧洲大陆——去不了美洲——坐不了热气球——不能独自游历威尔士——可怜的奴隶——你的处境将比黑人还糟——再加上可怕的贫穷（除非妻子比天使还好，而且有钱）。别在意，小伙子——振作起来——人不能过这种孤独的生活，任由虚弱的晚年、无友无伴、寒冷与无儿无女的未来盯着自己，而自己已经开始长皱纹。别在意，相信运气——留神寻找——幸福的奴隶也有许多。")]
